- Notification Data Dictionary:
  - Notification ID  Integer  Unique identifier for the notification. 
  - User ID  Integer  The ID of the user the notification  belongs to. 
  - Type Enum Text < 50 Characters  The category of notification (e.g., "BUDGET_ALERT", "GOAL_COMPLETE"). 
  - Message  Text < 255 Characters  The content of the notification. 
  - Is Read  Boolean  A flag indicating whether the user has viewed the notification. 
  - Timestamp  DateTime  The date and time the notification was generated. 


